                                "sense_id": "5ec04219-efb1-31b7-8495-4d3b88a561ab",
                                "text": "He wanted to see less marshalling of trains, and a move away from a culture that allowed 85% of a wagon's life to be spent \"empty, being used as storage bins for goods or in sidings as coal scuttles\"."
